@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### List devices
GET {{host}}/devices

### Register a valid device
POST {{host}}/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "DEV-001", "name": "Boiler Meter", "location": "Block A" }

### Register a device with an EMPTY id (accepted on master - rejected after the feature)
POST {{host}}/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "", "name": "Unknown", "location": "Block B" }

### Register a DUPLICATE device (accepted on master - rejected after the feature)
POST {{host}}/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "DEV-001", "name": "Copy of Boiler Meter", "location": "Block A" }

### Billing estimate
GET {{host}}/billing/estimate?units=100
